# templ output only. `linguist-generated` collapses these by default in GitHub
# diffs and drops them from the repo's language statistics. The files are still
# committed and still reviewable — just folded, so a templ version bump does not
# bury hand-written changes in the same pull request. Reproduce with
# `make templ-generate`.
#
# sqlc (internal/db/sqlc/) and protoc (*.pb.go) output is deliberately NOT
# marked, so those diffs stay expanded and get read.
*_templ.go   linguist-generated=true
